    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79384" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρέν-θεσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>putting in beside : giving besides</i> or
			<i>wrongly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς τροφῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					19.193
				</span></i>
			 (pl., s.v.l.) ; <i>injection</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				58
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>insertion</i>, of a tent in a wound, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				8.27
			</span></i> : Gramm., of letters, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				30.43
			</span></i> : in Tactics, of men in a rank, <i><span class="en">
				Ascl.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				6.1
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἱστοριῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					100.33
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>parenthesis</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Quint.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				9.3.23
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ -θεσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermog.
					<u>Id.</u>
					1.12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>application</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν χειλέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					5.708
				</span></i>
			.</div>
